  "description": "Works to trees protected by preservation order. T1 hawthorn, remove basal growth and crown reduce by 2m to clear lamp columns; T7 Lime, remove the deadwood, remove the basal growth and remove the epicormic growth to allow for a more detailed inspection as a full inspection was impeded; T8 Lombardy poplar, remove the basal growth, crown reduce by 4.5m to address of concern of decay in trunk, the tree is the subject of a previous reduction and is also hidden by T7 reducing the amenity value. Work is for safety and to allow for a detailed inspection of the trunk",
